invalid type: string "## Contraindications and Warnings\nMetformin is contraindicated in patients with eGFR below 30 mL/min/1.73m2 and should\nbe used with caution (reduced dose) between 30-45 mL/min/1.73m2. Metformin should be\ntemporarily discontinued in patients with acute kidney injury or before procedures\nusing iodinated contrast media, due to risk of lactic acidosis.", expected a booleanÿÿÿ